    "extraction_notes": "Single SoA table (ISA Section 1.3) on document pages 11-12 under a header reprinted on p.12; the intro text on p.11 (delta statement and pointer to the master and DPNP DSA SoAs) is captured as table-wide note g1. Both pages are glyph-spread (one token per glyph or glyph group): every activity label, header label and Notes cell was rebuilt from the glyph stream and read again against the rendered page (§1c). Marks verified by pdftotext -bbox column binning (no disagreement with the visual read). Cell boundaries from raster rule lines (§1d). Notes column cells captured as annotations with synthesised markers n1-n12 (two cells split by the sentences that name visits). Abbreviation list dropped (it carries one CCI box). Redaction: the rows of the 'Scales, Questionnaires, and Outcome Measures' group (p.11), one full row below 'PK sample' (p.12) and the Notes cell of 'Participant returns device'.",
    "model": "claude-opus-5-5"
